Problem Statement
Generate a report for every completed delivery showing the route name, driver name, delivery time, and the average
delivery time of all completed deliveries within the same route.
• Use AVG() as a window function with PARTITION BY route_id.
• Only status = 'Completed' should be included.
• Delayed and Cancelled deliveries must not appear and must not affect the route average.
• Round the calculated average delivery time to 2 decimal places.
• Sort by route_name, delivery_time, driver_name.
